    "updated_at": "2025-03-17T22:32:53Z",
    "body": "The test also uses `remove()`, ensuring that the \"removing steps\" and \"moving steps\" behave the same. I have run the test in all implementations with `moveBefore()` converted to `remove()` (so `moveBefore()` doesn't appear _at all_) and the tests pass in all implementations, so this spec change is definitely right. I think it's fine for the tests to reflect the latest spec, but if you want me to separate the tests, I can.",
